flowchart TD
  A[Candidate artifact] --> B[Record origin, SHA-256, class, platform, architecture]
  B --> C{Authorization state documented?}
  C -- no --> M[Manifest-only; no original bytes published]
  C -- yes --> D{Scope permits this storage/publication?}
  D -- no --> M
  D -- yes --> O[Store immutable original]
  O --> T[Reproducible tool analysis]
  T --> V[Independent verification]
  V --> R[Qualified derived documentation]
